    "type": "report",
    "kind": "pr",
    "title": "Fix Regression in Window Boundary Check",
    "body": "This patch addresses a regression introduced in the window boundary logic. The test 'test_reconcile_window_boundary' was failing due to an assertion error where date(2026, 9, 8) was incorrectly considered within the window [date(2026, 9, 1), date(2026, 9, 8)]. The issue stems from the inclusive end comparison in the `in_window` function. The fix changes the condition from `txn_date <= end` to `txn_date < end`, making the end of the window exclusive. This resolves the regression, as verified by passing the test and lint checks in the sandbox. The change was approved by the Critic after 3 checks.",
    "prUrl": "https://github.com/acme/ledger-core/pull/692",
    "dryRun": true
